Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: "Who Touched the High-Water Mark First?"
- Story & Context: When harbor security cut the generator lines during the dawn gathering at Mirae Tower, Min-Seo kicked her steel resonator guitar into an impromptu porch stomp, daring three hundred soaked ravers to race the incoming high tide across the slippery ledge of the 80th-floor parapet. The smell of burning marine diesel and mashed persimmons filled the air as the crowd stomped the tempo on corrugated iron, shouting the chorus back into the searchlight beams until the patrol boats gave up and floated away with the current. "We gambled our dry boots on the rising sun," Min-Seo sang without a microphone, her breath rattling through a green melodica as saltwater splashed over her bare ankles.
